        "slc_319867a34cfa31fb2ef094b0dbd6cf35c76828c6b8b0718e5728af820cbaab1e"
      ],
      "text": "HM-RAG is described as a hierarchical multi-agent multimodal RAG framework for dynamic knowledge synthesis across structured, unstructured, and graph-based data."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b12c37f35091948c8423cc837122f60b4c39ff58ea73ca807a363db11c141177",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d0712d463da4b2b6a95e6428cd9a9d1c39c7583e",
          "git_sha": "1c09bf54e3385b94a3d495ddc6c1e44fa32d74a2",
          "line_end": 23,
          "line_start": 23,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ocean-luna/hmrag",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocean-luna/HMRAG/blob/d0712d463da4b2b6a95e6428cd9a9d1c39c7583e/README.md#L23-L23"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_319867a34cfa31fb2ef094b0dbd6cf35c76828c6b8b0718e5728af820cbaab1e"
      ],
      "text": "The framework uses a three-tier agent architecture: a Decomposition Agent, parallel modality-specific Multi-source Retrieval Agents, and a Decision Agent."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c60cf8a768005ec37c0fde5cb9dbf8b9b3a227320923174f7b1c5e1eab8777b1",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d0712d463da4b2b6a95e6428cd9a9d1c39c7583e",
          "git_sha": "1c09bf54e3385b94a3d495ddc6c1e44fa32d74a2",
          "line_end": 23,
          "line_start": 23,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ocean-luna/hmrag",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocean-luna/HMRAG/blob/d0712d463da4b2b6a95e6428cd9a9d1c39c7583e/README.md#L23-L23"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_319867a34cfa31fb2ef094b0dbd6cf35c76828c6b8b0718e5728af820cbaab1e"
      ],
      "text": "A Decomposition Agent splits complex queries into coherent sub-tasks via semantic-aware query rewriting and schema-guided context augmentation."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6500a2eff501ec3504b624bb2f3154cc2e48b0f6d25cd510ef7cd566417b1664",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d0712d463da4b2b6a95e6428cd9a9d1c39c7583e",
          "git_sha": "1c09bf54e3385b94a3d495ddc6c1e44fa32d74a2",
          "line_end": 23,
          "line_start": 23,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ocean-luna/hmrag",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocean-luna/HMRAG/blob/d0712d463da4b2b6a95e6428cd9a9d1c39c7583e/README.md#L23-L23"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_319867a34cfa31fb2ef094b0dbd6cf35c76828c6b8b0718e5728af820cbaab1e"
      ],
      "text": "Retrieval agents run parallel, modality-specific retrieval using plug-and-play modules for vector, graph, and web-based databases."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8041d4fc06299755ac133cfee761ed0e35550f61f1020be32a1055d72bdfeae4",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d0712d463da4b2b6a95e6428cd9a9d1c39c7583e",
          "git_sha": "1c09bf54e3385b94a3d495ddc6c1e44fa32d74a2",
          "line_end": 23,
          "line_start": 23,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "ocean-luna/hmrag",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocean-luna/HMRAG/blob/d0712d463da4b2b6a95e6428cd9a9d1c39c7583e/README.md#L23-L23"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_319867a34cfa31fb2ef094b0dbd6cf35c76828c6b8b0718e5728af820cbaab1e"
      ],
      "text": "A Decision Agent integrates multi-source answers via consistency voting and resolves retrieval discrepancies through Expert Model Refinement."
    },
